    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπετ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάμπω</span>
			, <i>shine</i>, only in 
				Ep.
			
			part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπετόων</span>
			<i>shining</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσσε δέ οἱ πυρὶ λαμπετόωντι ἐΐκτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.104
				</span></i>
			
			=
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.662
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				390
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστρα λαμπετόωντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					110
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τείρεα λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1362
				</span></i>
			.</div>
